{"unit_id":"koliy82__dsh-rustvy#feature-1","repo":"koliy82/dsh-rustvy","commit":"72682822c604f55bc908501b6d87d142d26d8c4a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Rustvy 的功能「模型目录同步」：读取提供商模型端点并规范化模型资料，比较现有配置后在设置界面展示差异，供用户生成更新配置。由设置页触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/models.js:110-165","lib/host.js:5266-5282","client/client.js:2131-2145"]}
