{"unit_id":"koliy82__dsh-rustvy#feature-4","repo":"koliy82/dsh-rustvy","commit":"72682822c604f55bc908501b6d87d142d26d8c4a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Rustvy 的功能「可用性面板」：设置页与模型选择器读取多个时间范围的状态和错误计数，供用户查看模型近期响应情况。打开界面时触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/uptime.js:1-30","lib/host.js:5288-5303","client/client.js:1440-1460"]}
{"unit_id":"koliy82__dsh-rustvy#feature-5","repo":"koliy82/dsh-rustvy","commit":"72682822c604f55bc908501b6d87d142d26d8c4a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Rustvy 的功能「代理设置」：用户在设置页配置 HTTP 或 SOCKS 代理，host 侧据此处理插件连接。由用户启用或调整代理时触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/proxy.js:1-30","lib/host.js:200-215","client/client.js:3750-3770"]}
