{"unit_id":"koliy82__dsh-rustvy#caveat-2","repo":"koliy82/dsh-rustvy","commit":"72682822c604f55bc908501b6d87d142d26d8c4a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"多个密钥的值交由 DSH credentials 服务保存；插件本地保存密钥标签与引用等元数据。需要 DSH 提供 credentials 和配置编辑服务才能完整管理密钥路由。见 docs/api-keys.md:24-32。","source":"generated","evidence":["docs/api-keys.md:24-32"]}
